        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global Grade 2 Crash Bar Exit Device</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series ED-301 crash bar\u001d style exit devices are suitable for medium or wide stile aluminum and hollow metal doors including store front glass doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThey have a 1\" diameter round cross bar that will fit doors up to 36\" wide and can be field sized to accommodate narrow doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/wide-door-crash-bar-exit-device-global-ed-301-48\"><b>Wide Door Crash Bar Exit Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Global ED-301 Crash Bar Exit Device:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 7-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1\" diameter round steel cross bar, stainless steel springs</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 1-1/4\" wide x 7-1/4\" long with 1/2\" stainless throw</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/32\" from face of stop to center line of device</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Rim mounted roller strike with shim</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile: 2-5/32\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non Handed (Reversible for Left or Right Hand Doors) </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: Up to 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: Recommended installation at 39-13/32\" from floor to center line of latch or strike assemblies</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with sheet metal, machine screws and shoulder mounting studs with set screws</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Optional <a href=\"/products/rim-cylinder-lock-global-th1100-rc\"><b>Rim Cylinder</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/high-security-rim-cylinder-with-horizontal-tail-piece-mul-t-lock-206sp-rim1ht-xx\"><b>Mul-T-Lock High Security Rim Cylinder</b></a></li>\r\n<li>Dogging: Inside - thumbturn dogging</li>\r\n<li>Grade 2</li>\r\n<li><b>UL Listed (45R7) for Panic Hardware</b></li></li>\r\n<li>Manufactures Warranty: 1 Year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Exterior Trim:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/rim-cylinder-lock-global-th1100-rc\">Rim Cylinder Lock</a>: Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Unlatch (Open) door from exterior with Key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/high-security-rim-cylinder-with-horizontal-tail-piece-mul-t-lock-206sp-rim1ht-xx\">High Security Rim Cylinder</a>: Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Unlatch (Open) door from exterior with Key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-en-08-phl\">Escutcheon Plate Keyed Classroom Lever</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key. Escutcheon Plate (1-1/2\" wide x 6-7/8\" high) with ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Exit Device is available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "36-inch or less Grade 2 Exit Device, Global ED-301",
                "description": "Global ED-301, 36-inch or less Grade 2 Exit Device - Global Series ED-301 crash bar\u001d style exit devices are suitable for medium or wide stile aluminum and hollow metal doors including store front glass doors. Modern styling and available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.",
